<title>USA: Urban Shopping finishes Old Orchard purchase.</title>
<headline>Urban Shopping finishes Old Orchard purchase.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Urban Shopping Centers Inc said Thursday it has completed its acquistion of the Chicago-area Old Orchard Shopping Center from an affiliate of Zell/Merrill Lynch Real Estate Opportunity Partners Ltd Partnership II.</p>
<p>In November, Urban said it agreed in principle to buy the mall for $106 million in cash and securities. It said the deal was subject to $160 million in existing liabilities.</p>
<p>Urban is a self-administered real estate investment trust.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
